  "subdivision_of_building": "The proposal affects only the following specific parts of the building:\n\nUnit 1 - 1st Floor (41A Manor Park Crescent)\n\nDetailed breakdown of affected areas:\nFirst Floor: Total internal reconfiguration to create a 3-bedroom HMO unit. This includes the creation of three bedrooms with private ensuite bathrooms and a communal kitchen/dining/living area.\n\nSecond Floor: The planning documents (specifically Drawing PR05 and the concurrent application summary) indicate that the \"means of escape\" and certain internal sections of the second floor levels are included within the 41A planning unit boundaries.\n\nNote on Building Context: The development is confined entirely to the upper residential level - first floor (41A) and does not affect the ground-floor commercial retail unit (41), which remains in use as Gary Green Memorials. The works are internal and do not change the existing building footprint or external envelope.",
